<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: TENNIS-PIOLINE BEATS ULIHRACH IN CZECH OPEN FINAL.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-PIOLINE BEATS ULIHRACH IN CZECH OPEN FINAL.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-05-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of the final of the Czech</p>
<p>Open on Sunday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>4-Cedric Pioline (France) beat 3-Bohdan Ulihrach (Czech</p>
<p>Republic) 6-2 5-7 7-6 (7-4)</p>
</text>
